{"ts":"2026-07-26T10:48:39.251Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-26T10:48:39.251Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-26T10:48:39.250Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Measured 2026-07-26 against the published 2026.7.26: post-publish verification covers execution only. verify-published-release.mjs runs npx --yes <pkg> --version, npx --yes --package <pkg> -- pm --version, and bunx --bun <pkg> pm --version. No install path is exercised for any manager — not npm install -g, not a project install, not bun add, not pnpm add — so packaging omissions and binary-link defects reach users through a green pipeline. Confirmed working by hand and therefore available as a starting fixture: bun add @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.7.26 links pm, pm-cli, and pm-mcp, and pm init, pm create, and pm list all succeed under the Bun runtime. The third check's invocation shape is separately defective and is owned by pm-lpqln4."}]}],"before_hash":"7d761bac6a13fde4f4185413b7d93338f1411e0e6d5bb938ac967dc145848dcb","after_hash":"f71773dc3348acbc2ababc6beb56625584035479fd2fa26007a51f4747fb28fa"}
