{"ts":"2026-07-31T21:34:36.710Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"1c17958768ac1d5a00e7bd9f","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-31T21:34:36.710Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:34:36.710Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Delivery evidence 2026-07-31: release automation now installs the exact registry version into unrelated npm and Bun roots, asserts executable containment, and runs a ten-step cold agent lifecycle covering init, orient, create, claim, annotate, evidence linking, close, validate, and context with per-step output bounds and aggregate token cost. Failure reports name the manager and step; unit controls cover containment and budget failures. Live 2026.7.31 acceptance passed for both managers: 10 steps each, 19,568 characters and 4,892 estimated tokens. This item remains active because the hosted OS matrix and previous-release control session are not yet implemented."}]}],"before_hash":"9daf854bb1847ec97844eecd7aef909efb5b8f86f5ac556123eb65e705b2c618","after_hash":"0e6c764e82779713c200c23275990287b786a2decaad94b2d189721c8e48eddc"}
{"ts":"2026-07-31T21:51:09.099Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"1c17958768ac1d5a00e7bd9f","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:51:09.098Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"CI portability evidence 2026-07-31: Windows exposed that the installed-agent escape negative control recognized only POSIX node_modules/.bin separators. The fixture now uses node:path separators and derives an outside path on the current drive, preserving the same containment assertion on Windows and POSIX. The focused 8-test verifier suite passes, ESLint passes, and the full 6,623-test coverage run remains exact 100/100/100/100."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-31T21:51:09.099Z"}],"before_hash":"0e6c764e82779713c200c23275990287b786a2decaad94b2d189721c8e48eddc","after_hash":"4a05f4592b2ed4ddb1d13c99b654dda6a182dcbb83fbbbc40d0cc31300f3f774"}
